	(text "PCM5102 datasheet filter lives on the DAC sheet:\nDAC_OUT -- 470R -- PRE_POT, 2.2nF from that node to GND.\nThat network assumes ~10 kOhm. MAX97220A Zin is ~10 kOhm.\n\nMAX_VOL will be set by R_IN and R_F. R_IN will stay at 10k \nbut can change R_F as needed to ensure safe volume during operation."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
